    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003090160,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜、別にアイドルになりたくて\r\n２８３プロに来たわけじゃないけど",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300309/1023003090160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003090170,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "でも、アイドルってすっごく楽しいし～……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300309/1023003090170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003090180,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "だけど、今までいた誰かみたいに……とか\r\nこういうアイドルになりたいっていうのがあるわけじゃなくて",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300309/1023003090180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003090190,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "『アイドル』はこういうもの！\r\nとか言われてもよくわかんないから",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300309/1023003090190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003090200,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……だから、雛菜は、雛菜になればいいよね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300309/1023003090200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003090210,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ていうか、もう\r\n『アイドル』を雛菜にしちゃえばいいのかも！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300309/1023003090210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………！\r\nあはは……うん、そうだな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003090220,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "へ～……\r\nプロデューサー、なんで笑うの～？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300309/1023003090220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、はは……すまん\r\nすごい発想力だなと思ってさ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも……なんでだろうな\r\n雛菜なら、できるだろうなって思っちゃうのは",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003090230,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "…………！",
